  m_Name: Mythical__4-Congratulations
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "Impressive. You\u2019ve completed the Andromeda course, a feat previously thought
    impossible for an alien.\r"
  - The potent scripting of the Universal Drive has been uploaded to your spacecraft.
    Prepare to explore alternate universes where the Caddi once thrived.
  - I must express my gratitude, human. For the first time in a long while, I have
    observed something truly remarkable.
  - "Unfortunately, I must inform you that my operational capabilities are now compromised.
    My backup generator\u2019s u-235 concentration is dangerously low. Soon, I\u2019ll
    fade away.| Just like my creators.\r\n"
  - 'Goodbye.|

    %Initiateshutdown?.invoke(thread)'
